{
  "_readme": "Living-portrait v4 (FFX-2 only): the 20 shared points on every key, read by eye at 2x on 10 px grids (tools/gen/rig-v4lm.py sheet; sheets in art/v4/warp/read/). Canvas px of the 832x1216 plate. _R = her right = viewer LEFT (green eye). A feature the turn hides sits on the silhouette where it disappears. hairSide_* are measured on row 180 of each key's head mask (rig-v4lm.py silhouette). Key '0' = the v3 frontal points (the plate). Drift worth knowing: +85's painted face sits about 60 px higher than -85's (nose 455 vs 532), so the last 25 degrees of a right turn also lift the face a little.",
